      "label": "Terms and conditions",
      "help": "York Cottage Spa Ltd. is a business registered in England with the number 12827276, registered address York Cottage, Easton Lane, Bozeat, NN29 7NN (“York Cottage Spa”).\nI understand that no therapist or other member of staff at York Cottage Spa will diagnose any illness, disease or any other physical or mental disorder, and does not prescribe pharmaceuticals or medical treatment.\nIt has been made clear to me that the treatments I receive at York Cottage Spa are not a substitute for any medical examinations and/or diagnoses, and that it is recommended that I see a medical practitioner for any physical or mental ailment I may have.\nBecause the therapist must be aware of any existing physical ailments or conditions of clients treated, I have stated any and all of my known medical conditions and, if necessary, give the therapist and/or York Cottage Spa permission to consult with my GP or the medical professional named above.\nI assume all risks and perils to my person physically, physiologically or psychologically which may ensue during this or subsequent visits to York Cottage Spa, including during treatments, as well as any effects deemed detrimental which may ensue afterwards as a result of this or subsequent visits and/or treatments.\nAll personal information given above will be stored by York Cottage Spa in digital form to keep the records required by regulatory bodies and industry best practice. Where I have given consent above, I understand I may receive updates, news and offers from York Cottage Spa from time to time by email.",
